WEBVTT

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:26.350
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:27.480
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:28.690
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:28.690 --> 00:00:29.860
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:31.030
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:32.280
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:51.460
<b>Restoration Plan No. 12

00:01:52.850 --> 00:01:57.710
What luck that they had a 
special sale on sprouts today.

00:02:14.150 --> 00:02:16.360
It's a mana crystal!

00:02:16.590 --> 00:02:18.580
Today's my lucky day!

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:21.820
I never would've expected to find 
a mana crystal just like that!

00:02:24.760 --> 00:02:25.610
<i>Wait.</i>

00:02:26.170 --> 00:02:28.840
<i>No way is getting a mana crystal this easy.</i>

00:02:30.980 --> 00:02:32.210
<i>Don't tell me...</i>

00:02:34.510 --> 00:02:36.510
<i>Is this a trap by that magical girl?</i>

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:42.820
<i>That was close.</i>

00:02:42.820 --> 00:02:46.860
<i>Damn her! She's trying to crush me 
and that mana crystal in one blow!</i>

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:49.560
<i>Where is she hiding?</i>

00:02:54.710 --> 00:02:57.230
Hiding won't get you anywhere, magical girl!

00:02:57.230 --> 00:03:00.050
You think I'd fall for such an obvious trap?!

00:03:00.050 --> 00:03:01.740
Get out here!

00:03:13.220 --> 00:03:14.990
Am I just imagining things?

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:17.170
Trying to scare me...

00:03:17.960 --> 00:03:18.840
<i>Wait a minute.</i>

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:20.550
<i>What about the manhole underneath?</i>

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:28.180
<b>A
H
H
H
H
H</b>

00:03:28.340 --> 00:03:29.480
<i>Is it a trap?</i>

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:32.940
<i>Does she want me to fall down there
so she can lock me in?!</i>

00:03:33.470 --> 00:03:36.420
<i>That must be it. I've done that a lot myself.</i>

00:03:36.420 --> 00:03:39.650
<i>She wants to look down on me 
after I fall in and laugh at me!</i>

00:03:39.830 --> 00:03:40.500
<i>Too bad!</i>

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:42.050
<i>This is nothing!</i>

00:03:42.050 --> 00:03:45.370
<i>I just have to make sure not to step on it.</i>

00:03:46.900 --> 00:03:48.830
You think I'm stupid?!

00:03:49.150 --> 00:03:52.840
Now this crystal will be mine...

00:03:53.910 --> 00:03:56.560
That thing under it looks like a button.

00:03:57.120 --> 00:03:59.190
What could it be?

00:04:10.590 --> 00:04:11.860
<i>An explosion?</i>

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:13.730
<i>Is it going to explode?!</i>

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:16.190
<i>Picking that up will be the last thing I do...</i>

00:04:16.410 --> 00:04:20.300
<i>She wants to blow me to smithereens, 
along with the entire city!</i>

00:04:22.510 --> 00:04:25.240
Curse you, magical girl.

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:28.310
This is so cruel!

00:04:30.890 --> 00:04:33.340
What are you playing, Hy-chan?

00:04:37.090 --> 00:04:39.540
Are you trying to kill me?!

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:42.210
It looked like you rolled 
over all by yourself to me.

00:04:42.370 --> 00:04:45.200
You freaking idiotmorondumbass!

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:46.180
You're so mean.

00:04:46.380 --> 00:04:48.520
I almost died!

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:50.000
Really?

00:04:51.320 --> 00:04:52.470
Jeez.

00:04:52.470 --> 00:04:54.980
Were you doing something that dangerous?

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:58.310
I was trying to pick up that 
mana crystal over there.

00:04:59.460 --> 00:05:00.720
This right here?

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:02.650
Boss, stop!

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:10.320
<i>You're Jahy-chan, so "Hy-chan" for short.</i>

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:12.880
<i>What a good girl.</i>

00:05:13.530 --> 00:05:14.730
<i>Hy-chan!</i>

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:18.620
Don't touch that!

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:23.460
It's a trap! Boss!

00:05:23.690 --> 00:05:25.120
Oh, really?

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:35.310
Nothing happened.

00:05:35.310 --> 00:05:36.320
What about the trap?

00:05:36.720 --> 00:05:37.920
The explosion?

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:38.980
And you, boss?

00:05:40.250 --> 00:05:41.980
I'm completely fine.

00:05:45.890 --> 00:05:47.900
<i>What a relief!</i>

00:05:47.900 --> 00:05:52.670
<i>So there was no trap and no magical girl!</i>

00:05:53.930 --> 00:05:56.230
Isn't that great, Hy-chan?

00:05:56.230 --> 00:05:59.900
But I never knew you could find 
a mana crystal in a place like this.

00:06:01.650 --> 00:06:06.320
<i>It was really easy to get, but I'm exhausted.</i>

00:06:07.520 --> 00:06:09.390
<i>Even though she acquired a mana crystal,</i>

00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:12.900
<i>the Great Jahy found herself short on words.</i>

00:06:16.330 --> 00:06:18.880
Wow, this place is huge!

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:20.720
I can't believe it.

00:06:20.720 --> 00:06:21.580
You see?

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:25.320
We might find a mana crystal here,
don't you think, Great Jahy?

00:06:25.550 --> 00:06:26.260
Yeah!

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:28.080
Good job, Kokoro!

00:06:29.220 --> 00:06:31.090
I'm going to look over there.

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:32.820
You take that side.

00:06:32.820 --> 00:06:33.970
Got it!

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:38.960
<i>Kokoro's a really useful human.</i>

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:40.710
<b>Tomarou</b>

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:41.150
<i>As expected of my right hand!</i>

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:42.170
<b>FAILURE</b>

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:44.630
Since she so helpful on 
my mana crystal hunts,

00:06:44.850 --> 00:06:49.240
I might even make her an officer 
once I restore the Dark Realm.

00:06:56.410 --> 00:06:58.680
Is that... a slide?

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:00.810
What an odd design.

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:02.770
Speaking of, that reminds me...

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:06.510
<i>The big park has a really huge slide.</i>

00:07:06.510 --> 00:07:08.380
<i>Let's go slide together!</i>

00:07:08.840 --> 00:07:10.690
Didn't she say that?

00:07:10.690 --> 00:07:13.190
I should tell her what I found!

00:07:13.880 --> 00:07:16.700
<i>Wait, what am I so excited about?</i>

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:23.920
Mana crystals! Come on, mana crystals!

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:25.400
We don't have time to play around!

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:27.490
What's that?

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:33.590
You're such a coward, Kokoro!

00:07:33.590 --> 00:07:35.300
This is so much fun!

00:07:37.760 --> 00:07:41.420
I just said I have no interest 
in these childish play structures!

00:07:41.420 --> 00:07:43.060
They're so silly.

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:45.980
Now where's that mana crystal?

00:07:47.410 --> 00:07:51.610
Oh, how pretty. Kokoro might like this.

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:53.230
I'll take it for her.

00:07:54.880 --> 00:07:57.200
What the hell am I doing?!

00:07:57.650 --> 00:08:01.630
<i>Me, picking a flower for a human?!</i>

00:08:01.630 --> 00:08:03.580
<i>I'm the Dark Realm's second-in-command!</i>

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:06.040
<i>Everyone lives in terror of me!</i>

00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:10.940
That's right... Kokoro's my servant,

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:13.470
and it's a master's job to reward servants.

00:08:13.470 --> 00:08:15.510
It's necessary from time to time.

00:08:15.780 --> 00:08:18.300
And she's a simple soul.

00:08:18.300 --> 00:08:22.480
I bet if I give her a flower, 
she'll work even harder for me.

00:08:22.700 --> 00:08:24.070
What a cute flower!

00:08:24.070 --> 00:08:25.020
I'm so happy!

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:27.370
I'll try my hardest 
to find those mana crystals!

00:08:27.370 --> 00:08:29.390
Thank you, Great Jahy!

00:08:32.880 --> 00:08:36.250
She's also the one who wanted to slide,

00:08:36.250 --> 00:08:37.920
so I'll just tell her it's there.

00:08:40.970 --> 00:08:42.910
<i>She's not here, huh?</i>

00:08:42.910 --> 00:08:44.690
<i>How far did she go? Sheesh.</i>

00:08:44.690 --> 00:08:45.690
Kokoro?

00:08:45.690 --> 00:08:47.010
Kokoro!

00:08:51.580 --> 00:08:53.170
Kokoro!

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:54.630
Get the hell...

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:58.800
away from Kokoro!

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:03.140
What's up with this lady?

00:09:03.300 --> 00:09:06.880
What the hell were you doing,
grabbing her arm?!

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:08.700
Wait, Great Jahy!

00:09:08.700 --> 00:09:12.820
He just saved me because I almost tripped.

00:09:13.350 --> 00:09:14.450
Huh?

00:09:15.100 --> 00:09:17.560
Oh. I totally misread that...

00:09:20.900 --> 00:09:22.160
<i>Just now...</i>

00:09:22.810 --> 00:09:27.630
<i>the supremely powerful, terrifying, evil
Great Jahy of the Dark Realm...</i>

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:27.040
<b>Supremely powerful</b>

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:27.920
<b>Supremely terrifying</b>

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:27.920
<b>Supremely evil</b>

00:09:29.070 --> 00:09:30.550
Great Jahy?

00:09:31.370 --> 00:09:35.620
<i>...rushed in to save a human girl?</i>

00:09:36.810 --> 00:09:40.050
<i>It can't be! It can't be!
 It can't possibly be!</i>

00:09:40.630 --> 00:09:44.460
<i>I'm supposed to be here
 collecting mana crystals with her,</i>

00:09:44.460 --> 00:09:48.140
<i>and yet my body's acting
 of its own accord for some reason!</i>

00:09:48.140 --> 00:09:49.440
<i>Why?</i>

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:51.020
That flower...

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:53.860
Oh, I found it earlier.

00:09:54.370 --> 00:09:56.630
I was going to give it to you.

00:09:57.300 --> 00:10:00.750
You probably don't want it when 
it's like this... do you?

00:10:01.220 --> 00:10:02.020
I do!

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:08.680
I'm so happy!

00:10:08.680 --> 00:10:10.790
Thank you, Great Jahy!

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:14.230
And that kick earlier was really cool.

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:15.840
You just went <i>sproing</i>

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:17.040
and <i>kapow</i>!

00:10:17.560 --> 00:10:20.550
You really are amazing.

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:24.400
You're just so cool, Great Jahy!

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:27.810
Kokoro...

00:10:29.110 --> 00:10:33.900
<i>I knew it. She's not like other humans.</i>

00:10:35.810 --> 00:10:36.920
By the way...

00:10:36.920 --> 00:10:40.970
I found that slide you 
mentioned the other day.

00:10:41.440 --> 00:10:43.850
Let's go slide together, Great Jahy!

00:10:43.850 --> 00:10:45.450
Yeah, let's go!

00:10:56.100 --> 00:10:58.310
What's wrong?

00:10:58.310 --> 00:10:59.610
We need to get out of here!

00:10:59.610 --> 00:11:01.800
Those guys are always bad news!

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:07.470
Hey, you over there!

00:11:07.470 --> 00:11:08.780
Stop!

00:11:11.960 --> 00:11:13.380
Get on my back!

00:11:17.450 --> 00:11:18.570
Where'd she go?

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:25.800
Maybe it's okay now.

00:11:25.800 --> 00:11:27.090
They're tenacious.

00:11:27.090 --> 00:11:28.320
Let's stay here for now...

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:30.060
They're probably in the octopus.

00:11:30.060 --> 00:11:32.620
Stop hiding and come out!

00:11:33.850 --> 00:11:34.990
Listen to me.

00:11:34.990 --> 00:11:38.810
While I distract them, I want you to flee.

00:11:38.810 --> 00:11:39.880
I can't do that!

00:11:40.680 --> 00:11:44.520
Don't worry. I'll never let them catch me.

00:11:44.520 --> 00:11:45.930
Great Jahy...

00:11:52.780 --> 00:11:54.480
Playtime's over.

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:58.020
You think I'd let you 
measly humans capture me?

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:01.780
Stop!

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:03.410
Never!

00:12:07.710 --> 00:12:09.380
We said stop!

00:12:09.380 --> 00:12:10.410
No!

00:12:15.780 --> 00:12:17.010
Get down from there!

00:12:17.010 --> 00:12:18.300
Never!

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:22.720
Halt!

00:12:22.860 --> 00:12:24.180
I can't!

00:12:31.510 --> 00:12:33.060
Why did you run from us?

00:12:33.450 --> 00:12:34.740
Because you were chasing me!

00:12:34.740 --> 00:12:36.820
You started running as soon 
as you saw police.

00:12:37.340 --> 00:12:40.960
I h-haven't done anything wrong.

00:12:42.860 --> 00:12:46.300
Anyway, we'll contact your 
landlord like last time.

00:12:46.300 --> 00:12:50.750
Anything but that!

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:34.580
<i>How the heck did this happen?!</i>

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:52.810
All right.

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:58.630
My genius invention is finally complete!

00:14:00.090 --> 00:14:04.250
With this, I shall take my rightful place
 as the Dark Realm's second-in-command!

00:14:06.540 --> 00:14:08.920
I may have suffered defeat at 
Jahy's hand multiple times,

00:14:08.920 --> 00:14:11.780
but I didn't give up and spent
 the last few months completing my potion.

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:14.870
I call it... Woof Woof DX!

00:14:16.430 --> 00:14:19.780
When she drinks this, she'll turn 
into a dog both mentally and physically,

00:14:19.780 --> 00:14:22.220
and she'll have no choice 
but to follow <i>my</i> orders!

00:14:23.450 --> 00:14:28.950
In other words, once Jahy drinks this, 
<i>I'll</i> be second-in-command!

00:14:28.950 --> 00:14:31.080
Oh, how long I've waited for this!

00:14:31.080 --> 00:14:34.350
I spent so many 
sleepless nights perfecting it.

00:14:56.280 --> 00:14:57.040
Huh?

00:15:00.740 --> 00:15:02.100
<i>Now I've done it!</i>

00:15:02.100 --> 00:15:06.390
<i>I mistook it for the tea sitting next
to it and accidentally drank it all!</i>

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:09.120
<i>I'm such an idiot!</i>

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:12.960
<i>No, this is not the time to wallow in misery.</i>

00:15:12.960 --> 00:15:15.470
<i>It's fine! I'll be back to normal with time.</i>

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:19.580
<i>And once I am, I'll make
 a new batch of Woof Woof DX!</i>

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:22.210
<i>I just have to keep calm and wait it out.</i>

00:15:22.210 --> 00:15:23.730
<i>Keep calm and...</i>

00:15:25.270 --> 00:15:26.340
<i>I can't do it!</i>

00:15:26.340 --> 00:15:27.830
<i>I want to go outside!</i>

00:15:27.830 --> 00:15:29.480
<i>I want to run around!</i>

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:31.950
<b>GASP</b>

00:15:31.790 --> 00:15:32.700
<i>Wh-What am I doing?</i>

00:15:33.180 --> 00:15:35.680
<i>I can't go around outside 
like this. It's dangerous!</i>

00:15:35.680 --> 00:15:37.660
<i>I was just telling myself to stay calm,</i>

00:15:37.990 --> 00:15:39.920
<i>but my body keeps moving.</i>

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:45.110
<i>Hey, you're the jerk dog from before!</i>

00:15:57.650 --> 00:16:00.530
<i>I can't speak anymore...</i>

00:16:03.220 --> 00:16:05.630
<i>But that dog got what I meant.</i>

00:16:07.010 --> 00:16:08.660
<i>This is bad.</i>

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:11.530
<i>At this rate, I'll become a dog for real!</i>

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:19.580
<i>Jahy?!</i>

00:16:19.740 --> 00:16:21.350
I haven't seen you around here before.

00:16:21.350 --> 00:16:22.450
Are you new?

00:16:22.900 --> 00:16:25.460
<i>Damn you, Jahy! This is your fault!</i>

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:28.230
<i>It's your fault this happened to me!</i>

00:16:29.850 --> 00:16:30.830
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:16:30.830 --> 00:16:34.390
<i>Fine, then... I'll just bite you!</i>

00:16:35.090 --> 00:16:37.100
There, there, there.

00:16:41.530 --> 00:16:42.420
Here, huh?

00:16:42.420 --> 00:16:43.830
Is that the spot?

00:16:43.830 --> 00:16:46.770
<i>Yes, right there... That's it...</i>

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:48.650
<i>This is all wrong!</i>

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:51.160
<i>I'm not a dog!</i>

00:16:51.160 --> 00:16:53.280
<i>And I certainly won't be Jahy's lapdo—</i>

00:16:53.510 --> 00:16:54.520
Fetch!

00:16:54.520 --> 00:16:55.700
<i>Yay!</i>

00:16:57.460 --> 00:16:59.370
<i>How is this so much fun?!</i>

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:01.000
There, there, there!

00:17:01.740 --> 00:17:03.120
Want me to throw it again?

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:03.800
Woof!

00:17:03.800 --> 00:17:04.870
Fetch!

00:17:06.690 --> 00:17:07.880
Fetch!

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:10.840
Yeah, go get it!

00:17:19.020 --> 00:17:20.360
That was fun.

00:17:20.360 --> 00:17:21.550
See you.

00:17:25.810 --> 00:17:28.770
<i>That was so much fun!</i>

00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:30.360
<i>That's not what I wanted!</i>

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:32.370
<i>What are you doing, playing around like that?!</i>

00:17:32.370 --> 00:17:33.840
<i>What are you, a dog or something?!</i>

00:17:33.840 --> 00:17:35.810
<i>Wait, I guess I am right now.</i>

00:17:35.810 --> 00:17:37.700
<i>No, I am </i>not<i> a dog!</i>

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:38.870
<i>Ah, jeez!</i>

00:17:39.170 --> 00:17:40.440
<i>And the worst part is...</i>

00:17:40.440 --> 00:17:43.830
<i>I enjoyed being treated like one by Jahy!</i>

00:17:49.660 --> 00:17:54.080
<i>Have I really become a dog in my heart?</i>

00:17:56.870 --> 00:17:58.200
<i>This is the worst.</i>

00:17:58.710 --> 00:18:01.480
<i>I wish I'd return to normal already.</i>

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:09.400
<i>It's that punk who took my money!</i>

00:18:09.770 --> 00:18:11.250
<i>Y-You're scary!</i>

00:18:11.250 --> 00:18:12.610
<i>Stay away from me!</i>

00:18:20.840 --> 00:18:22.470
No collar, huh?

00:18:22.470 --> 00:18:23.690
You a stray?

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:29.670
Sorry. I can't have dogs at my place.

00:18:29.870 --> 00:18:30.870
Take care.

00:18:38.170 --> 00:18:40.230
<i>She wasn't scary...</i>

00:18:41.400 --> 00:18:44.080
<i>I was always terrified of her.</i>

00:18:46.210 --> 00:18:50.410
<i>Maybe people are just nicer to dogs.</i>

00:18:52.250 --> 00:18:54.650
<i>Jahy wasn't scary either.</i>

00:18:55.230 --> 00:18:58.180
<i>Maybe staying like this for a 
while isn't so bad after all.</i>

00:19:04.780 --> 00:19:05.900
<i>Now?!</i>

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:11.020
<i>Saurva returned to normal
without (too much) incident.</i>

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:14.460
Craft Pub <b>Maou.</b>

00:19:14.810 --> 00:19:18.660
So, today, I ran into this 
really friendly dog.

00:19:18.660 --> 00:19:20.680
Oh, how nice.

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:24.660
What a nice li'l fuzzball!

00:19:25.420 --> 00:19:30.730
<i>It's said that there was never 
another batch of Woof Woof DX.</i>

00:21:02.460 --> 00:21:04.990
Where are we going today, Great Jahy?

00:21:05.250 --> 00:21:09.720
We'll hit that park we went to before 
and look for more mana crystals.

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:10.750
Okay!

00:21:10.750 --> 00:21:14.210
But there's somewhere I want to go first.

00:21:14.930 --> 00:21:16.910
Since we're going a bit farther today,

00:21:16.910 --> 00:21:18.150
we should buy some snacks.

00:21:18.150 --> 00:21:19.020
Okay!

00:21:19.600 --> 00:21:24.170
Oh, but my mom said I shouldn't 
buy anything wasteful.

00:21:25.150 --> 00:21:28.540
Don't worry! Today's my treat.

00:21:28.540 --> 00:21:30.530
What? I can't let you do that.

00:21:30.530 --> 00:21:31.770
It's fine!

00:21:31.770 --> 00:21:34.140
You're always helping me out, so...

00:21:34.590 --> 00:21:37.350
Where was the candy shop again?

00:21:42.240 --> 00:21:43.700
Huh? What is this?

00:21:43.700 --> 00:21:45.430
It's called a crane game.

00:21:45.430 --> 00:21:49.740
You put in money, move the claw
 to the thing you want, and grab it.

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:51.780
My dad's really good at these.

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:54.570
Wh-Wh-What?

00:21:54.570 --> 00:21:57.830
Y-You're saying I can get that many 
tasty sticks for just a hundred yen?!

00:22:00.050 --> 00:22:01.800
Good luck, Great Jahy!

00:22:01.800 --> 00:22:04.010
Indeed. I've got this.

00:22:04.380 --> 00:22:09.150
<i>If I snag it with ease, 
she'll look up to me even more.</i>

00:22:10.010 --> 00:22:11.860
What is this?!

00:22:11.860 --> 00:22:13.180
Fine, one more time!

00:22:16.620 --> 00:22:17.850
One more time!

00:22:19.470 --> 00:22:20.470
One more!

00:22:25.190 --> 00:22:26.650
<b>Change Machine</b>

00:22:25.190 --> 00:22:26.650
Return

00:22:25.190 --> 00:22:26.650
Cancel

00:22:25.190 --> 00:22:26.650
 Insert 1000 yen

00:22:29.320 --> 00:22:32.070
Great Jahy, we should stop.

00:22:32.070 --> 00:22:34.080
<i>I'm in too deep.</i>

00:22:34.320 --> 00:22:36.540
<i>This is a fight to the death.</i>

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:39.530
<i>I'll get it if it's the last thing I do.</i>

00:22:42.210 --> 00:22:43.960
Th-This is all I've got left.

00:22:49.880 --> 00:22:51.100
Oh, no!

00:22:56.860 --> 00:22:58.260
I got it!

00:22:58.260 --> 00:23:00.270
Great Jahy, you're amazing!

00:23:04.820 --> 00:23:06.940
It's yummy, huh, Great Jahy?

00:23:10.750 --> 00:23:11.360
Indeed.

00:23:11.930 --> 00:23:14.640
Oh, this steak flavor is really good!

00:23:14.640 --> 00:23:16.850
This strawberry flavor 
is really tasty, too!

00:23:16.850 --> 00:23:18.650
Is it? Nice, nice.

00:23:18.960 --> 00:23:23.960
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:18.960 --> 00:23:23.960
<b>Druj Is Not Happy!</b>
